"https://huggingface.co/datasets/ShareGPT4Video/ShareGPT4Video` |"

msgid ""
"Some datasets are hosted on Hugging Face. If Hugging Face is not directly\n"
"    accessible from your network, you can use a third-party mirror for downloads\n"
"    made through `huggingface_hub` or the Hugging Face `datasets` library:"
msgstr ""
"某些数据集托管在 Hugging Face 上。如果您的网络无法直接访问 Hugging Face，\n"
"    您可以使用第三方镜像来下载通过 `huggingface_hub` 或 Hugging Face `datasets`\n"
"    库进行的下载："

msgid ""
"`HF_ENDPOINT` does not rewrite URLs passed directly to `wget` or `git clone`.\n"
"    For these commands, replace `huggingface.co` in the URL with an accessible\n"
"    mirror explicitly. The availability of third-party mirrors is not guaranteed\n"
"    by vLLM or vLLM Ascend. `VLLM_USE_MODELSCOPE=True` controls model and tokenizer\n"
"    loading in vLLM; it does not redirect benchmark dataset downloads to ModelScope."
msgstr ""
"`HF_ENDPOINT` 不会重写直接传递给 `wget` 或 `git clone` 的 URL。\n"
"    对于这些命令，请显式地将 URL 中的 `huggingface.co` 替换为可访问的镜像。\n"
"    vLLM 或 vLLM Ascend 不保证第三方镜像的可用性。`VLLM_USE_MODELSCOPE=True`\n"
"    控制 vLLM 中的模型和分词器加载；它不会将基准测试数据集下载重定向到 ModelScope。"

